@startuml 22_seq_fleet_refresh
actor Operator
participant "Flutter FleetScreen" as UI
participant "Monitoring API" as API
database SQLite as DB
Operator -> UI : Open dashboard
loop Every 5 seconds
 UI -> API : GET /api/v1/hosts
 API -> DB : Fetch latest samples and lastSeenAt
 DB --> API : host data
 API -> API : derive CONNECTED/STALE from receive time
 API --> UI : host list, age and metrics
 UI -> UI : render without fabricating missing values
end
@enduml
